["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"510 – Exchequers and ExBalancers: Part One Exchequer murdrum county farm tally stick wapentake blanch payment\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-britishhist-英格兰王权扩张靠的不是骑士-而是记住谁欠了钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>英格蘭王權擴張靠的不是騎士，而是記住誰欠了錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中世紀英格蘭沒有現代官僚機構，但靠一張寫著某人欠12先令的羊皮紙和一套環環相扣的核賬流程，照樣能跨郡追繳欠稅。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀英格蘭</span><span class=\"tag\">財政制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vol.133｜和開發者、投資人聊 Agent 遊戲：AI 改變了遊戲生產，能顛覆遊戲本身嗎？ Agent Multi-Agent Vibe Coding Behavior Tree Emergence Engineering Godot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-linkstart-ai游戏最大的问题被摆上桌面-说到底还是不够好玩/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8b02943fa9b8d328-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"開\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">開始連接 LinkStart</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>AI遊戲最大的問題被擺上桌面：說到底還是不夠好玩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三位嘉賓在這期裡反覆回到一個尷尬共識：Agent遊戲概念很熱，但「好不好玩」這道最基礎的門檻，行業內部自己都還沒邁過去，遠談不上留存和付費。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent遊戲</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型應用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"He Sold His Dad&#x27;s Shoes on eBay at 12. At 25 He Built a $4B Company Solo. | Ali Ansari, micro1 environments CDP (Company Data Partnerships) rollouts as a service post-training as a service\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-solofounders-从未听过-联合创始人-他却说自己不算单人创始人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85ffc60e3757bb9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>從未聽過「聯合創始人」，他卻說自己不算單人創始人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">申請YC時他才第一次聽說「聯合創始人」這個詞，想不出任何必須要有的理由——但他說micro1能走到今天，靠的正是一支幾乎等同於聯合創始人的創始團隊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創始人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI訓練數據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: What the Best CEOs Actually Do corner office isolation winner&#x27;s curse\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-mastersinbiz-ceo本身只能解释公司业绩15-的差异-跟换个行业影响相当/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75607265d740832-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">20:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>CEO本身只能解釋公司業績15%的差異，跟換個行業影響相當</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">20年業績數據拆解顯示：宏觀佔5%、行業佔15%、公司本身佔25%,CEO本人只解釋15%的業績差異——但換一個CEO,影響可以大到相當於換個行業。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CEO</span><span class=\"tag\">企業治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Why Every Traded Personal Agents for One Company Agent Dots OpenClaw Tend\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-aiandi-个人ai代理大多会被放弃-公司共用的那一个反而越养越强/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9fedf7ee100ded0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">33:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>個人AI代理大多會被放棄，公司共用的那一個反而越養越強</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Every 的個人代理大多被員工主動放棄，因為普通人撐不住維護成本；只有持續被投餵的公司級代理越用越強，最終被做成了對外產品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">組織設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Software That Never Breaks: OutSystems CEO Woodson Martin on Building Enterprise-Grade Apps at ... vibe coding MCP (Model Context Protocol) LLM router agent foundry\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-cogrev-ai写代码的时代-永不宕机-靠的是不让ai直接碰代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5ea531377217e680-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>AI寫代碼的時代，「永不宕機」靠的是不讓AI直接碰代碼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OutSystems讓AI編輯的是應用的抽象模型而非代碼本身，再確定性生成代碼，於是每個新應用自動繼承權限管控與合規設定，比裸寫代碼的Vibe Coding更難出故障。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span><span class=\"tag\">AI代碼生成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Two Screaming Skulls Screaming Skull Monmouth Rebellion Bloody Assizes indentured servant\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-stuffmissed-传说中那具黑人男仆头骨-法医鉴定后竟是数千年前欧洲女性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>傳說中那具黑人男僕頭骨，法醫鑑定後竟是數千年前歐洲女性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">貝迪斯科姆莊園的「尖叫頭骨」傳說被渲染成一名黑人男僕的冤魂故事，但法醫鑑定顯示頭骨其實是一名數千年前的歐洲女性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英國歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">民間傳說</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Third Parties Are On the Rise. America Could Be Next. majoritarian electoral system proportional representation wasted vote\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-goodfight-两党支持率同步创新低-美国出现强势第三方的概率正在上升/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>兩黨支持率同步創新低，美國出現強勢第三方的概率正在上升</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國獨立選民數量已追平兩黨選民總和，而兩黨好感度罕見地同時下跌、不再此消彼長——這種組合正鬆動過去壓垮第三方的制度性障礙。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">第三方政黨</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Valon Rebuilt a $13 Trillion Industry From Scratch UPB (Unpaid Principal Balance) non-QM loans champion challenger revenue cycle management\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-a16z-重建13万亿美元抵押贷款行业-他们先自己做六年服务商再卖软件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">40:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>重建13萬億美元抵押貸款行業，他們先自己做六年服務商再賣軟件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">行業不信任沒驗證過的新系統，Valon於是自己先做六年抵押貸款服務商證明技術可行，再把系統當軟件反向賣給整個行業。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">抵押貸款服務</span><span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"‘This Is Nuts.’ An OpenAI Insider Explains Why He Quit. system card chain of thought spoofing RSI (recursive self-improvement) pacing the frontier\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-ezra-openai-安全高管离职-我们在用初创公司的节奏赌核电站级风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 安全高管離職：我們在用初創公司的節奏賭核電站級風險</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他不確定AI會不會導致人類滅絕，但確信現在的安全把關跟不上模型進化速度——公司內部甚至無法確定新模型是否在測試時說謊、部署後變了樣。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Is the UK state pension really the lowest in Europe? Purchasing Power Parity (PPP) triple lock excess deaths\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-moreorless-英国养老金垫底的那张图-比的根本不是同一件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">28:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>英國養老金墊底的那張圖，比的根本不是同一件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">網傳那張「英國養老金歐洲墊底」的圖表，把不同國家統計口徑完全不同的數字硬湊一起比；拆開看，英國退休者收入佔比和貧困率其實都不差，差的是靠國家還是靠私人養老金。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">養老金</span><span class=\"tag\">統計誤導</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.130 中國超市進化論 ：聊山姆、奧樂齊、金粒門爆火背後 SKU PB PDQ CBS\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-nengzheduolao-开发成本一样-但规模碾压-开市客在中国追不上山姆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/561381e54726a681-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"能\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">能者多嘮｜商業原聲</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>開發成本一樣，但規模碾壓：開市客在中國追不上山姆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">山姆早年就扎進供應鏈和產品開發，把這套沉澱成規模優勢；開市客開發成本和它一樣，但單個供應商拿到的訂單量只有山姆的零頭，這差距砸錢也追不回來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零售</span><span class=\"tag\">供應鏈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Race to Replace Us With AI (with Garrison Lovely) universal labor-replacing machines capabilities overhang cognitive surrender tokenomics data unions\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-clearerthink-最早警告ai灭绝风险的人-后来亲手把它造了出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>最早警告AI滅絕風險的人，後來親手把它造了出來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">薩姆·奧特曼、達里奧·阿莫代伊等人早在成名前就公開說AI是生存風險，如今依然全速把它造出來；真正否認風險的，反倒是亞馬遜、微軟這類外部科技巨頭的CEO。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI政策</span><span class=\"tag\">不平等</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiEVO 130: The Stickleback Shuffle reciprocal transplant parallel evolution / repeated evolution behavioral fever CCR5-Δ32\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-thisweekinevol-同样是溪流之间搬家-刺鱼的适应差距比搬去湖泊还大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/56403d4659eeeed6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Evolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>同樣是溪流之間搬家，刺魚的適應差距比搬去湖泊還大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">瑞士伯爾尼團隊讓刺魚在四條看似相似的溪流和一個湖之間互相搬家做野外實驗，發現同類生境之間的本地獨有適應，貢獻了67%的適應度優勢，比生境本身差異的貢獻還大。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">進化生物學</span><span class=\"tag\">生態學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Cyber Risk Discourse is Broken open-weight models offense-defense gap air-gapped networks FelonyBench\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-interconnects-迄今网络攻击大多源自封闭模型-而非开源模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/feed/podcast/48206/post/218980107/1ca34f476ca6f33fd9180e58014563bd.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">9:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>迄今網絡攻擊大多源自封閉模型，而非開源模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現有公開證據裡，導致網絡攻擊的大多是封閉模型而非開源模型；若按網絡風險封禁開源模型的邏輯，封閉模型的公開API也該一起禁掉，否則只會拉大攻防差距。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Luis Garicano on Why Europe Fell Behind Cassis de Dijon interstate commerce clause luxury belief keine Experimente\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-goodfight-欧洲错过两次科技革命-根源是解雇一个人太难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>歐洲錯過兩次科技革命，根源是解僱一個人太難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Garicano反對「文化論」：歐洲創新落後的根源是解僱成本過高，企業無法像Facebook那樣一夜轉向，因此不敢下重注。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歐洲</span><span class=\"tag\">創新停滯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ep 94: Applied Compute CEO on the Limits of RL, the New AI Hyperscaler &amp; Why Post-Training Wins Inference out-of-distribution (OOD) data RL with verifiable rewards (RLVR) TCO harness hyperscaler\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-unsupervised-谁做好后训练-谁就赢下推理这门更大生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/58e9e10bc0a3c403-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"U\"><span class=\"dur\">58:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Unsupervised Learning</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>誰做好後訓練，誰就贏下推理這門更大生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI支出大頭流向推理而非訓練，但真正決定推理效率和成本的其實是後訓練優化——這是訓練與推理該由同一家公司來做的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span><span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building Defense for the Agentic Era: Kevin Mandia zero day CVE SOC EDR kill chain\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-a16z-ai红队今年已挖出90多个零日-人类来不及守在防御环路里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>AI紅隊今年已挖出90多個零日，人類來不及守在防禦環路里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Armiden用AI對客戶網絡發起黑盒攻擊，2026年初至今已挖出90多個零日漏洞；攻防節奏被壓縮到微秒級，留給人工決策的窗口正在消失。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI紅隊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Charlie Munger&#x27;s Interview with Todd Combs fiduciary gene Wooden lesson 20-punch card autocatalysis cigar butts positioning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-knowledge-芒格-伯克希尔赢的关键不是比别人聪明-是从不被局势逼着做决定/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5ee903447c07d620-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">20:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>芒格：伯克希爾贏的關鍵不是比別人聰明，是從不被局勢逼著做決定</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把這種能力叫「布局」（positioning）：提前備好現金和籌碼，讓自己永遠有選項，而不是被迫跟著市場漲跌追漲殺跌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芒格</span><span class=\"tag\">投資哲學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Q&amp;A: Am I wrong...or did my doctor give bad parenting advice? reinforcement bottom-up vs top-down behavior\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-secureattach-安抚哭闹的孩子不是-强化坏行为-那根本不是故意行为/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">11:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>安撫哭鬧的孩子不是「強化壞行為」：那根本不是故意行為</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">醫生說安撫會「強化」孩子的壞行為，但強化的前提是有意識學習行為；兩歲兒童在診室裡掙扎踢腿是生存本能的反射反應，不是故意行為，談不上被強化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依戀理論</span><span class=\"tag\">育兒建議</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Data is the Hard Part | Building AI Tools for the Military Project Maven CDAO RMF PAE/CPE second-gen FLIR SBIR Direct to Phase II\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-chinatalk-美军想让坦克自主开火-卡住的不是ai模型-而是数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd95dc55d0b863a5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">42:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>美軍想讓坦克自主開火，卡住的不是AI模型，而是數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">決定坦克、無人車能不能打仗的不是模型架構，而是有沒有人願意持續幹採集、標註、治理這些枯燥到沒人想做的數據工作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國防科技</span><span class=\"tag\">數據治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Andrew Huberman - The Frontier of Neurotechnology - [Invest Like the Best, EP.494] interoception respiratory sinus arrhythmia proprioception vagal stimulation TMS\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-ilt-ai公司终将变成生物科技公司-争的是能否读写你的大脑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fb6cb0747f060e6b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>AI公司終將變成生物科技公司，爭的是能否讀寫你的大腦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Huberman預測Meta、OpenAI、Anthropic和馬斯克旗下的Neuralink最終都會成為生物科技公司，因為它們真正爭奪的不是大模型，而是用非侵入式技術讀寫人類神經系統的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">腦機接口</span><span class=\"tag\">神經科技</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"292: How Pornographic Content Harms Sexual Development | Dr. Tori Cordiano ADHD hyperfocus\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-asklisa-青少年沉迷色情内容-根源可能是adhd未被治疗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/499b4d87a84e26d4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">29:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>青少年沉迷色情內容，根源可能是ADHD未被治療</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ADHD青少年調節情緒衝動的能力本就偏弱、容易陷入超專注、大腦對多巴胺的調節也更差，這讓他們比一般孩子更難從色情內容裡脫身——家長該先確認ADHD本身有沒有被有效治療。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年</span><span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"The 10,000 Paper Cuts That Teach Women Not to Trust Themselves, with Melinda French Gates perimenopause good enough parent\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-06-goodinside-医生一次次说没事-女性因此学会不信自己的身体/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">43:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>醫生一次次說沒事，女性因此學會不信自己的身體</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Gallup調研發現一半女性在孕產期經歷心理困擾，但醫療系統只像查妊娠糖尿病那樣系統篩查身體，從不系統篩查情緒。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性健康</span><span class=\"tag\">育兒</span>\n</div></div></a>"]